@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About VIIDII</PageTitle>

<style>
    .about-container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 2rem auto;
        padding: 0 1.5rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.125rem;
    }

    .about-header {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--r-lg);
        padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .about-header h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
        font-size: 1.875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .about-header p {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--text-mid);
    }

    .content-section {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 1.75rem;
        border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    }

    .content-section h2 {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .content-section p {
        color: var(--text-mid);
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
    }
    .content-section p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .feature-card {
        background: var(--surface-up);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-mid);
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-radius: var(--r);
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .feature-card p {
        color: var(--text-mid);
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .tech-stack {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .tech-badge {
        background: var(--surface-up);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-mid);
        color: var(--text-mid);
        padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 100px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
    }
</style>

<div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-header">
        <h1>About VIIDII</h1>
        <p>Session Attendance Management System</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>What is VIIDII?</h2>
        <p>
            VIIDII is a comprehensive Session Attendance Management System designed to streamline 
            the process of managing virtual and in-person educational sessions. Built with modern 
            web technologies, VIIDII provides a seamless experience for both educators and students.
        </p>
        <p>
            The platform enables lecturers to create and manage sessions, while students can easily 
            join and participate in real-time classes. With built-in attendance tracking and 
            real-time communication features, VIIDII ensures efficient session management.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Key Features</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Session Management</h3>
                <p>Create, schedule, and manage educational sessions with ease.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Real-time Communication</h3>
                <p>Built-in SignalR support for instant updates and notifications.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Role-based Access</h3>
                <p>Different interfaces for Students, Lecturers, and Administrators.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Attendance Tracking</h3>
                <p>Automatic attendance recording and status monitoring.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Department Filtering</h3>
                <p>Target specific departments and levels for your sessions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Admin Dashboard</h3>
                <p>Comprehensive system overview and user management tools.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
        <p>VIIDII is built using cutting-edge technologies to ensure performance, reliability, and scalability:</p>
        <div class="tech-stack">
            <span class="tech-badge">ASP.NET Core</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Blazor</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">SignalR</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">C#</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Real-time WebSockets</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Bootstrap</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <p>
            <strong>For Lecturers:</strong> Log in, create a new session with customizable parameters, 
            and share the session code with your students. Monitor attendance and manage participants 
            in real-time.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>For Students:</strong> Log in and join sessions either by entering a session code 
            or browsing available sessions. Your attendance is automatically tracked once you join.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>For Administrators:</strong> Access comprehensive dashboards to monitor system usage, 
            manage users, oversee all sessions, and maintain system integrity.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Contact & Support</h2>
        <p>
            For questions, support, or feedback about VIIDII, please contact your system administrator 
            or refer to your institution's IT support channels.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
